  "description": "One row per name printing in the earnings-week window (W0 + W1, printed or not) and one per Book line, with the day's suites side by side: the earnings-week calendar row, the alpha model's deciles and 7d / 28d bands, the entry book's 50-day band and kill, the safety band's buy-in-red bounce band and kill (this week and the Book), and the signal-lab print cells the row sits in now with each cell's measured mean, t and n. Zero cutoffs: order and choice belong to the page and the judgment. Tables month / month_ind put every alpha live row and each industry on the 28-day forecast with its GMV profile, as a regime read for the month ahead.",
